1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
I used to browse the internet without thinking twice.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,000
Open a link. Accept the cookies. Move on.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,500
Then I started learning cybersecurity.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:16,500
And suddenly, I started noticing everything behind the screen.

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:21,000
The permissions. The trackers. The little things I'd always ignored.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
The internet didn't change. The way I see it did.
